#: model:ir.module.module,description:__manifest__.py
msgid ""
"Adds \\\"Confirm\\\" and \\\"Cancel\\\" buttons to the tree view of\n"
"                      Sale and Purchase orders, allowing users to confirm or\n"
"                      cancel multiple records by selecting them directly from\n"
"                      the tree view."
msgstr ""
"Agrega los botones \\\"Confirmar\\\" y \\\"Cancelar\\\" a la vista de árbol de\n"
"                      Órdenes de compra y venta, permitiendo a los usuarios confirmar o\n"
"                      cancelar múltiples registros seleccionándolos directamente desde\n"
"                      la vista del árbol."

#: model_terms:views/purchase_order_views.xml
#: model_terms:views/sale_order_views.xml
msgid "Cancel Orders"
msgstr "Cancelar pedidos"

#: model:ir.module.module,summary:__manifest__.py
msgid "Confirm or Cancel Multiple Sale or Purchase Orders"
msgstr "Confirmar o cancelar varias órdenes de venta o de compra"

#: model_terms:views/purchase_order_views.xml
#: model_terms:views/sale_order_views.xml
msgid "Confirm Orders"
msgstr "Confirmar pedidos"

#: model:ir.module.module,name:__manifest__.py
